{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>無綫戀愛真人騷《女神配對計劃2》近日上演前度重逢戲碼，擁有傲人身材被封為咪神郭珮文與前男友俞鋆瑞Ice於節目中 …</p><p></p>\n<p>無綫戀愛真人騷《女神配對計劃2》近日上演前度重逢戲碼，擁有傲人身材被封為咪神郭珮文與前男友俞鋆瑞Ice於節目中高調放閃。二人除了互訴相戀近4年溫馨點滴，更在親密遊戲中挑戰極限距離疑似直接吻下去。這種原意為浪漫重燃愛火互動不但未能感動觀眾，反而引發排山倒海負面抨擊。\n</p>\n<h2>《女神配對計劃2》舊情重溫男方自爆每晚攬公仔</h2>\n<p>在心跳電話亭環節中，郭珮文選擇與前度俞鋆瑞Ice進行單獨互動。男方積極採取溫情攻勢，大談當年女方為他悄悄買下心儀褲子作為生日驚喜往事，強調這些細節讓他深感難忘。他隨後大拋深情宣言，自爆自分手後依然隨身攜帶一隻象徵郭珮文白熊公仔，甚至每晚都要抱著入睡，並揚言此舉是出於對女方保護慾望。</p>\n<h2>郭珮文俞鋆瑞Ice極限食糖疑真咀創紀錄</h2>\n<p>兩人隨後參與食鞋帶糖親密挑戰，俞鋆瑞展現極大自信聲稱贏得遊戲毫無難度。他們展現十足默契，最終將糖果咬至僅剩1.5厘米，成功打破全場紀錄。網上流傳節目截圖清楚顯示，雙方當時閉上雙眼且臉頰緊貼，雙唇距離極近，畫面疑似已經直接嘴對嘴親吻。這幕大尺度互動隨即在各大社交平台瘋狂傳閱。\n</p>\n<h2>網民冷眼狂酸拍拖多年大驚小怪</h2>\n<p>節目播出後，大批觀眾對這段前度甜蜜互動毫不買帳，討論區瞬間湧現大量嘲諷留言。不少網民直斥雙方早已有著近4年交往經驗，在鏡頭前刻意營造臉紅心跳曖昧感顯得極度虛偽。有人毫不留情地留言批評「拍咗3年拖有咩咁出奇姐」及「又唔係未錫過，呢啲small case」。網民普遍認為舊情人之間親密舉動根本毫無驚喜可言，狠批兩人在鏡頭前舉動純屬做騷。</p>\n<h2>狂轟戀綜變復合戰俞鋆瑞Ice惹反感</h2>\n<p>除了猛烈抨擊親暱互動，網民亦將矛頭直指節目性質與參與者動機。大量觀眾質疑男方特意上電視求復合只為製造話題，對其他真心參與求愛勇者極不公平，更狠批「節目可以改名做乜乜復合戰」及「好浪費時間嘅節目」。此外，俞鋆瑞鏡頭表現與外型同樣成為箭靶，部分網民對他毫不客氣地抨擊「呢個男人賊眉賊眼，唔知個女人鍾意佢啲咩」甚至直指「食得咁劣」，令這場尋愛戲碼徹底被負評淹沒。\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179298713136395322_14270453816adecffbd36c7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"julianakpm_1792935542_4015749634927898032_1400115974.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179298713136395322_14270453816adecffbd36c7.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@julianakpm）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179298713369279519_15129157866adecffe1eb2e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"VS--YouTube-2TVB-YouTube-10’54”.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179298713369279519_15129157866adecffe1eb2e.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179298713629950155_3271831516aded000a9a95.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2026-10-26 at 11.25.11.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179298713629950155_3271831516aded000a9a95.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/12_4085084256adaf5b22f4a9.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"女神配對計劃2 郭珮文 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/12_4085084256adaf5b22f4a9.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/02_2362759236ab6544fb820e-1024x1535.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"女神配對計劃2 約會 郭珮文追求者：俞鋆瑞（Ice）、李爾晨（Kyle）、伍頌曦（Preston）（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/02_2362759236ab6544fb820e-1024x1535.jpeg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>郭珮文追求者：俞鋆瑞（Ice）、李爾晨（Kyle）、伍頌曦（Preston）（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/17905201885117762_19005311796ab92b7ce1ef0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"女神配對計劃2 郭珮文 郭珮文與Ice比心心好Sweet！（圖片來源：《女神配對計劃2》記者會截圖）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/17905201885117762_19005311796ab92b7ce1ef0.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>郭珮文與Ice比心心好Sweet！（圖片來源：《女神配對計劃2》記者會截圖）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/21_10360100476ac33ec6a783c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"女神配對計劃2 郭珮文 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/21_10360100476ac33ec6a783c.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e4%bf%9e%e9%8b%86%e7%91%9e/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">俞鋆瑞</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a5%b3%e7%a5%9e%e9%85%8d%e5%b0%8d%e8%a8%88%e5%8a%832/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">女神配對計劃2</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%83%ad%e7%8f%ae%e6%96%87/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">郭珮文</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3530009\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nOct 26 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T05:22:19.427378+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1364,"images":7,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T03:59:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T07:18:33.889474+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T05:18:22.950052+00:00","content_hash":"8748215939a9c81db5d072e0c4caf4627c2d2928f1daf6b61b61a58c8a77fbb6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}